  &lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;Troubleshooting: If the add to cart button doesn't work, check that the tRPC API route is set up correctly at app/api/trpc/[trpc]/route.ts. Ensure the route handler uses createTRPCNextApiHandler and passes the request headers to the tRPC context.&lt;/p&gt;

