&lt;p&gt;🎯 Conclusion&lt;br&gt;
Tailwind CSS ne styling karne ka tarika puri tarah se badal diya hai. Shuru mein HTML ke andar itni saari classes dekh kar thoda ajeeb lag sakta hai, lekin ek baar jab aapko iski aadat ho jayegi, toh aap kabhi wapas traditional CSS ya Bootstrap par nahi jana chahenge.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Agar aapne abhi tak Tailwind try nahi kiya hai, toh apne next project (chahe wo Laravel ho ya Next.js) mein ise zaroor try karein. Happy Coding! 💻🚀&lt;/p&gt;

